    "short_description": "Grendel Jinx is in danger of having to repeat a school year. Refusing to allow this to happen, she enlists the services of the protagonist - her newly found &quot;Best Friend&quot; - and is promptly rebuffed. Grendels drastic actions to fix her problem soon attracts the attention of her mother.",
